# ADVERSARIAL - the producer is believed never to emit this, and SEGX/1 §3.6.1
# makes it a FAULT for a far-side executor. This vector exists to record what
# STOCK does instead, so the divergence is evidence-backed rather than asserted:
# st.step_count = 0, then the unconditional post-decrement at stepper.c:471
# wraps it to 65535 and the segment becomes a 65536-tick ghost that never
# retires. max_ticks cuts the trace short on purpose - a segment that retired
# would show a DRAIN instead of TICK_LIMIT, and that is the assertion.
gvec 1
name adversarial-nstep0
f_tick 16000000
pulse_ticks 160
max_ticks 40
pos 0 0 0

blk 1 80 0 0 80 0x00 0x00
seg 0 999 1 0 0
seg 4 999 1 0 0
